Package jose is written from scratch.

Third-party code: none is copied into this module. It depends on
github.com/decred/dcrd/dcrec/secp256k1/v4 (ISC License) for secp256k1.

Files ported from Apache-2.0 projects (jose/sdjwt, from sd-jwt-python and
eudi-lib-jvm-sdjwt-kt) carry a header naming their source file and are listed
here when they are added.
